'!FABMO!name:Manually set new XY Home
'!FABMO!description:Easily set offset distance from proximity switch for XY home
'!FABMO!enabled:true
' Name: Manually set new XY Home
' Description: Easily set offset distance from proximity switch for XY home (for changing default home position)
' 2026/8/15

' === Main Program =============
DIALOG "This Macro will set a new XY Home location for your tool."
IF &xyHOMED == "true" THEN GOTO Skip_M3
GOSUB Run_M3

Skip_M3:
SK "Exit Keypad after you have moved the tool to the the exact location for your new XY Zero (where you want X=0, Y=0)."

$SB_HOMEOFFUU[].X = $SB_HOMEOFFUU[&U].X + %(1)
$SB_HOMEOFFUU[].Y = $SB_HOMEOFFUU[&U].Y + %(2)

VA,,,,,,, 0, 0

DIALOG "XY Home has been reset to this location!" OKTEXT="OK", CANCELTEXT=FALSE

END

'===============================


' --- Primary Subroutines ---                                      
Run_M3:
DIALOG "First we will run the M3(C3) Macro to Home the tool."
C3
RETURN
